Package: pluto-ai
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pip, nodejs (>= 18.0.0), scrot, xclip, wmctrl, xdotool, chromium-browser | google-chrome-stable
Maintainer: PLUTO AI Team <pluto@example.com>
Description: PLUTO - Local AI Desktop Assistant
 PLUTO is a 100% free, local AI-powered desktop assistant for Linux.
 Features:
  - Voice commands and natural language understanding
  - Browser automation (YouTube, Google, etc.)
  - System control (screenshots, clipboard, volume)
  - Window management
  - File operations
  - Local intelligence (no API costs, privacy-first)
  - Pattern-based command matching
  - Memory and learning capabilities
 .
 Zero API costs, works completely offline with local intelligence.
Homepage: https://github.com/ASIM7815/pluto
